# Where the Vosk/Edge Impulse model files are served from. Leave unset —
# locally that falls back to /models (web/public/models/, gitignored,
# populate it yourself per README.md); on Vercel that same /models path is
# rewritten to an Edge Function (api/models/[...path].js) that fetches a
# GitHub Release and streams it back same-origin (required for it to work
# under this site's Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy — see the Deploy section
# in README.md for why pointing this straight at github.com breaks that).
# Only set this if you're hosting the models somewhere else entirely.
VITE_MODELS_BASE_URL=
